OL,3,GNEWSAMet gets more e-motorbikes to
OL,4,Afight phone thefts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has expanded
OL,7,Fits fleet of high-powered electric
OL,8,Fmotorbikes from five to 25 as part of
OL,9,Fan ongoing crackdown on phone snatchers
OL,10,Fand moped gangs across London.
OL,12,FThe lightweight vehicles allow officers
OL,13,Fto cut through heavy traffic, navigate
OL,14,Fnarrow alleyways, and ride up
OL,15,Fstaircases to catch suspects fleeing
OL,16,Fareas inaccessible to police cars or
OL,17,Fmotorcycles.
OL,19,FThe force said "targeted tactics" had
OL,20,Fhelped drive down phone thefts across
OL,21,Fthe capital by more than 13,000
OL,22,Foffences over the past year.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
