OL,3,GNEWSAMet gets more e-motorbikes to
OL,4,Afight phone thefts
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Assistant Commissioner Louise
OL,7,FPuddefoot said the e-motorbike fleet
OL,8,Fwas "a powerful tool to stay one step
OL,9,Fahead of criminals".
